    "collapsible_content_VTGeja": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_UQGxyU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<b>🐾 Features</b>",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Fetch on Autopilot — Play More, Worry Less</strong></p><p>The FetchMate™ takes over when your arm gives out. Its smart infrared sensor detects when a ball is dropped in and automatically launches it every 10 seconds — no buttons, no effort. Whether you're working from home or just need a break, your dog stays entertained, active, and happy.</p><ul><li><strong>3 Adjustable Launch Distances</strong> — 3m, 6m, or 9m to suit any room or backyard</li><li><strong>Smart Auto-Launch</strong> — Infrared sensor fires the ball every 10 seconds automatically</li><li><strong>One-Button Control</strong> — Single button powers on and cycles through distance settings</li><li><strong>USB Rechargeable</strong> — No batteries required; charges like your phone</li><li><strong>Compact Design</strong> — Small enough to tuck into any corner when not in use</li><li><strong>Works Indoors & Outdoors</strong> — Great for living rooms, patios, backyards, and hallways</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_grbCdy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<b>📋 Description</b>",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Keep Your Dog Active, Even When You're Busy</strong></p><p>The FetchMate™ Automatic Dog Ball Launcher is a compact, rechargeable launcher designed for dogs of all sizes. Available in two versions — Classic (48mm balls) and Upgraded (58mm ETPU balls) — there's a FetchMate suited to every breed and play style.</p><p>The Classic version uses a conveyor belt drive and comes with 6 soft 48mm tennis balls — ideal for small to medium dogs. The Upgraded version features a gear-side drive mechanism for greater reliability and power, with 6 larger 58mm ETPU balls that are better suited to medium and large breeds.</p><p>Both versions keep your pup physically active and mentally stimulated — helping to reduce boredom, restlessness, and the kind of mischief that comes with too much idle energy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6faRaE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<b>📦 What's Included?</b>",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Every FetchMate™ comes complete with everything you need to get playing straight out of the box:</p><ul><li><strong>1 × FetchMate™ Ball Launcher</strong> (Classic or Upgraded, based on your selection)</li><li><strong>6 × Soft Balls</strong> (48mm tennis balls for Classic / 58mm ETPU balls for Upgraded)</li><li><strong>1 × USB Charging Cable</strong></li><li><strong>1 × Instruction Manual</strong></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JEtXrk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<b>🛡️ Care + Safety</b>",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Built with Your Dog's Safety in Mind</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Soft, mouth-friendly balls</strong> — Both the 48mm and 58mm balls are designed to be gentle on your dog's teeth and gums</li><li><strong>Supervised introduction recommended</strong> — We suggest staying nearby the first few times your dog uses the launcher to help them get comfortable with the sound and motion. Also, start with the lowest launch distance</li><li><strong>Normal operational noise</strong> — The internal roller mechanism produces some sound during use; this is completely normal and expected</li><li><strong>For supervised play</strong> — The FetchMate™ is best used with your awareness, even though it operates automatically</li><li><strong>Indoor surfaces</strong> — When using indoors, ensure there is enough clear space in the launch direction and remove any fragile items from the play area</li></ul><p><strong>Caring for Your Launcher</strong></p><ul><li>Wipe down with a dry or slightly damp cloth; do not submerge in water</li><li>Store indoors away from extreme heat or direct sunlight</li><li>Charge fully before first use and when the indicator light dims</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7Fb49r": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<b>📐 Specifications</b>",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Classic</strong></p><ul><li>Ball Size: 48mm soft tennis balls</li><li>Launch Mechanism: Conveyor belt drive</li><li>Best For: Small to medium dogs</li><li>Launch Distances: 3m / 6m / 9m</li><li>Balls Included: 6</li><li>Power: USB rechargeable</li><li>Operation: One-button control</li><li>Auto-Launch Interval: Every 10 seconds</li><li>Detection: Infrared ball sensor</li><li>Unit Dimensions: 10.1 × 10.8 × 8.4 in</li><li>Use: Indoor & outdoor</li></ul><p><strong>Upgraded</strong></p><ul><li>Ball Size: 58mm ETPU balls</li><li>Launch Mechanism: Gear side drive</li><li>Best For: Medium to large dogs</li><li>Launch Distances: 3m / 6m / 9m</li><li>Balls Included: 6</li><li>Power: USB rechargeable</li><li>Operation: One-button control</li><li>Auto-Launch Interval: Every 10 seconds</li><li>Detection: Infrared ball sensor</li><li>Unit Dimensions: 10.1 × 10.8 × 8.4 in</li><li>Use: Indoor & outdoor</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WVpypx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<b>🚚 Shipping & Returns</b>",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Shipping</strong></p><ul><li>✨ FREE Worldwide Shipping on all orders</li><li>Orders are processed and dispatched within 1–3 business days</li><li>Estimated delivery: 5–10 business days (may vary by location)</li></ul><p><strong>Returns</strong></p><ul><li><strong>30-day returns </strong>from the date of delivery</li><li>If you're not completely satisfied, contact our team to initiate a return or exchange</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
